# Cloudflare Pages redirects (evaluated before the static file server, so
# these apply regardless of a build's trailingSlash setting).
#
# Only entries backed by something confirmed in this repository's own history
# are added here -- see AGENTS.md / DEPLOYMENTS.md context. The other "Not
# found (404)" pages reported by Search Console need the exact URLs from
# Page indexing -> Not found (404) before a redirect target can be chosen
# correctly; guessing at those would just create a second wrong URL.

# The product now at /collections/adizero-evo-sl/ was originally filed under
# the placeholder slug "a" (see git history: "Tidy the demo product left over
# from the old slug field"). Anyone who indexed or bookmarked the old address
# lands on the same product instead of a 404.
/collections/a/  /collections/adizero-evo-sl/  301

# @astrojs/sitemap only ever wrote /sitemap-index.xml; nothing on the site or
# in Search Console should be pointed at /sitemap.xml, but redirecting it
# costs nothing if an old submission or backlink still uses that name.
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap-index.xml  301
